    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 715.85pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"954\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Stage</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 677.05pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"903\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Description</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">L1</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 677.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"903\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Localized tumour not involving vital structures as defined by the list of image-defined risk factors and confined to one body compartment</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">L2</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 677.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"903\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Locoregional tumour with presence of one or more image-defined risk factors</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">M</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 677.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"903\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Distant metastatic disease (except stage MS)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">MS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 677.05pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"903\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Metastatic disease in children aged &lt;&nbsp;18&nbsp;months with metastases confined to skin, liver, and/or bone marrow</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Note: See Monclair et al., 2009 </span><span class=\"Ref-PMID\" style=\"color: #984806; background: #ccc0d9;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{19047290}</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">, for detailed criteria. Multifocal primary tumours should be staged according to the greatest extent of disease as defined above.</span></p>",
